{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118939","id":3582427625,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Vh4Hp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118939","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118939.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118939.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118939","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118939/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118939/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118939/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/00ecb770f9a73a9a0111069afab34f31e5ad9b68","number":118939,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Windows] - Extend_To_Title (Client Side Decorations)","user":{"login":"MattParkerDev","id":61717342,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzE3MzQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61717342?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev","html_url":"https://github.com/MattParkerDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"#### Summary\r\n\r\nImplements `extend_to_title` on Windows, for Vulkan, D3D12 and OpenGL3_Angle.\r\nOpenGL3 doesn't support drawing to a full client area window, so is feature flagged off.\r\nThis is only support for Windows in this PR. I plan to implement Linux support in a further PR.\r\n\r\n#### Motivation\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4846\r\nOther similar unmerged PRs: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96310, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117086\r\n\r\n#### Demos\r\nRunning project:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c612f8a3-0b1a-4aa9-aab0-7f0724c11f94\r\n\r\nGodot Project Manager:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1327\" height=\"1013\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc4f91c7-72b7-48ce-bc08-7a524cc1d7d8\" />\r\n\r\n###\r\n\r\nGodot Editor:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1747\" height=\"1125\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/019bdf21-0172-41d5-b789-d24e235f13cb\" />\r\n\r\n### \r\n\r\nat 200% Windows Scaling: (Ignore the rest of UI being too small - my app is not auto DPI aware)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2559\" height=\"1439\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54cd0780-34dc-4bc0-8963-050d90ebc0d4\" />\r\n\r\n### \r\n\r\nNote that if you are attempting to test this with the godot project manager, you will need to run it with `--rendering-driver vulkan` or d3d12 or opengl3-angle, as the projet manager defaults to the compatibility renderer, which uses opengl3 by default.\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","co